-- Room Combine Video Routing
-- by Skip Mussett / Cursor Agent
--
-- Purpose: room-combine video source routing (Setup / Global Sources / Room tabs).
-- Version 6.7.x is documentation/clarity + SDK structure; keep functional parity
-- with 6.6.9 pin tree, Counts, and layout sizes.
--
-- Architecture (limits: Count ≤ 256 per Name, and ≤ 256 schematic pins total):
--   Control slot 1..40: fixed stride (4 locals/room + 8 globals). Room 2 Src 1
--     is always slot 5 even when Sources Per Room is 2.
--   Dense AV (OutputStrings default): packed from active properties with no gaps.
--     Format: setupOutputStringFormat true→"AV N" (Name), false→"N" (Number).
--   Combos / Output pins : rooms x outs  (outputFlatIndex). These are the
--     routing pins (max 32+32). Source Combo = Both; Output = Output.
--   Select buttons       : arrays rm#Out#Rm#Src (Count = Sources Per Room)
--     and rm#Out#Global (Count = Global Source Count; omitted at 0).
--     UCI/Component.New: rm2Out2Global3 is index 3 of rm2Out2Global —
--     Boolean true is a source press (same as the faceplate Select).
--     Input pins when (otherPins + select instances) <= 256.
--     Exclusive per column (setColumnSelects).
--     PrettyName stays "Room N Output M <label>".
--   Labels: rm#OutSourceLabels (Count = Sources Per Room) plus
--     globalOutSourceLabels (Count = Global Source Count, or 1 if 0).
--     PrettyName is Rm N Src M Label / Global N Label.
--     OutputStrings: one shared control per dense AV (sharedSlotIndex).
--     Unpinned. Edited on Setup (Select preview + Labels + Output).
--     Room tabs and Global Sources show Select legends only.
--
-- Pin PrettyName (~ nesting) ONLY on UserPin controls. Designer builds a
-- pin tree from every '~' PrettyName and stops at 256 — with Selects nested
-- that cut off at Room 5 Output 1. Faceplate-only names stay flat (no ~).
--   Pinned: Properties~… ; Status~Debug ; Room N~Output M~Output | Source Combo
--   Unpinned: rm#Out#Rm#Src#, Labels, options, Mirror / Show Globals, Global tab.
--   Setup + every Room tab draw an all-rooms routing strip (Combo / Output /
--   Mirror / Global / Vis) so those writes stay Style!=None. No off-canvas park.
-- Global tab globalOutput / globalSourceControls stay unpinned.
-- Source Combo pins ComboBox String. Selects are faceplate Boolean only.
--
-- Runtime write gates (Designer faceplate quirks):
--   muteHandlers()  — block EventHandlers without isUpdating; use for String /
--     Legend / Choices / IsInvisible / Boolean faceplate commits.
--   suppressing() / isUpdating — ONLY for re-entrancy around non-faceplate work.
--     Designer often drops String/Legend/Choices/IsInvisible/Boolean while true.
--   Rising-edge Selects: act only when Boolean == true (false = release/interlock).
--   Vis OFF clears Mirror All and Mirror 1–4; any Mirror ON forces Visibility ON.
--   Mirror All: fan the selected source to every output in this room.
--     Other rooms receive it only when they are in the same combination
--     and also have Mirror All on. An uncombined room stays in-room.
--     Off-page Combo / Output / Mirror stay styled (parked) so Designer
--     cannot drop Boolean/String writes on rooms 6–8.
--     routedSlotByFlat is the source of truth: every mirrored flat is cached
--     in the first handler. Combo / Output / Select faceplate writes are
--     chunked (8 columns per tick) so Designer cannot drop rooms 5–8.
--     Timer.CallAfter(0) continues until every column is written.
--     All true forces Mirror 1–4 false; turning Mirror N on clears Mirror All.
--   Mirror N: copy Output N to Output N of every other combined room that
--     also has Mirror N on. An uncombined room keeps Output N in-room
--     (and can still hold a foreign source after peers drop).
--   Combined Mirror: a room joining a mirrored group adopts that group's
--     current source (does not stomp it with its own Src 1). Mirroring a
--     global turns on Global N on every destination output so the route
--     is not replaced by the first local source.
--   Global All: sets Global 1–4 on or off together (room + Setup).
--   Global N: show or hide global source Selects/combo choices on Output N.
--
-- Tabs: Style=None in GetControlLayout only. Do NOT page-scope IsInvisible by
-- page_index (6.6.5–6.6.6 blanked Room tabs). Runtime IsInvisible is product
-- rules only (Global/Vis/combine, unused slots beyond counts).
-- Re-drag after changing Room/Sources/Outputs/Globals (or pin tree changes).

PluginInfo = {
  Name = "Room Control~Combine Video Routing",
  Version = "6.56.7",
  BuildVersion = "6.56.7.0",
  Id = "b8d4e3f2-9c3d-5b7e-0d9f-2e6f8a1b4c5d",
  Author = "Skip Mussett",
  Description = [[
Room combiner video routing. Setup, Global Sources and Room tabs.
Selects are arrays rm#Out#Rm#Src / rm#Out#Global whose Count follows
