that source. Input pins when the pin budget allows.
PrettyNames stay Room N Output M <label>. Re-drag required.
Routing pins: comboBoxRm#Out# (Both) and outputRm#Out# (Output).
Mirror N: rm#Out#Mirror (Count=1).
Labels are rm#OutSourceLabels / globalOutSourceLabels (PrettyName Rm N Src M Label / Global N Label). OutputStrings stay shared per AV. Edited on Setup. Property mirrors under Properties~.
